Input: {"question": "2017 Census of which country was conducted?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 0, "end": 161, "text": "2017 Census of Pakistan The 2017 Census of Pakistan was a detailed enumeration of the Pakistani population which began on 15 March 2017 and ended on 25 May 2017."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 162, "end": 275, "text": "The census was conducted by the Pakistan Bureau of Statistics for the first time in 21st century, after 19 years."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 276, "end": 349, "text": "Initial estimates would put the population at 20 crore (210–220 million)."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 350, "end": 497, "text": "The provisional results were finally presented to the Council of Common Interests on August 25, 2017, and then approved and released to the public."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 498, "end": 570, "text": "The results showed a total population of Pakistan at 207,774,520 people."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "start": 571, "end": 608, "text": "Pakistani general election, 2018 were"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 0, "end": 28, "text": "Pakistani general election ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 29, "end": 98, "text": "2023 [ edit ] This section is an excerpt from 2023 Pakistani census ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 99, "end": 241, "text": "[ edit ] The 2023 Census of Pakistan was the detailed enumeration of the Pakistani population and the seventh national census in the country ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 242, "end": 318, "text": "[ 32 ] [ 33 ] [ 34 ] It was conducted by the Pakistan Bureau of Statistics ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 319, "end": 437, "text": "[ 35 ] It was also the first ever digital census to be held in Pakistan , including the first in South Asian history ."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d01", "start": 438, "end": 495, "text": "[ 36 ] The census was initially held from 1 March 2023 to"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "rules out military role in 7th digital census ''."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 50, "end": 70, "text": "The Express Tribune."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 71, "end": 85, "text": "23 March 2022."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 86, "end": 130, "text": "Archived from the original on 13 March 2022."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 131, "end": 155, "text": "Retrieved 13 March 2022."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 156, "end": 243, "text": "^ `` Canada's first-ever digitised population census to be completed in August 2022 ''."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 244, "end": 253, "text": "Geo News."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 254, "end": 271, "text": "23 February 2022."}, "D3S9": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 272, "end": 316, "text": "Archived from the original on 13 March 2022."}, "D3S10": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 317, "end": 341, "text": "Retrieved 13 March 2022."}, "D3S11": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 342, "end": 423, "text": "^ `` Canada's 7th Population Census Postponed for Lack of Technical Equipment ''."}, "D3S12": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 424, "end": 437, "text": "Propakistani."}, "D3S13": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 438, "end": 454, "text": "ProPakistani.PK."}, "D3S14": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 455, "end": 470, "text": "12 August 2022."}, "D3S15": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d02", "start": 471, "end": 516, "text": "Archived from the original on 12 August 2022."}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "2017 Peru Census The 2017 Peru Census was a detailed enumeration and twelfth national population census of Peru."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 113, "end": 213, "text": "It was conducted by the Instituto Nacional de Estadística e Informática on Sunday, October 22, 2017."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 214, "end": 313, "text": "Its full name in Spanish is XII Censo de Población, VII de Vivienda y III de Comunidades Indígenas."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 314, "end": 372, "text": "The previous census performed in Peru was the 2007 Census."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 373, "end": 545, "text": "The census form had 47 questions referring to households and basic services, housing, methods of travel and formation of families; such as gender, disability and ethnicity."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 546, "end": 619, "text": "A question on ethnic self-identification was included in the 2017 census."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "start": 620, "end": 630, "text": "Comparison"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 0, "end": 43, "text": "the family ) , and other spoken languages ."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 44, "end": 158, "text": "Iceland edit The first Icelandic census took place in 1703 , following upon the first Danish census of 1700–1701 ."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 159, "end": 218, "text": "Further censuses were carried out in 1801 , 1845 and 1865 ."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 219, "end": 379, "text": "The 1703 exercise was the first census ever to cover all inhabitants of an entire country , mentioning the name , age , and social position of each individual ."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 380, "end": 474, "text": "All of the information still exists , although some of the original documents have been lost ."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d04", "start": 475, "end": 539, "text": "The need for censuses was eliminated through the setting up , in"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Pakistan", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Peru", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d00:c0", "entity": "2017 Census", "scope": "Country", "claim": "The 2017 Census of Pakistan was a detailed enumeration of the Pakistani population.", "answer": "Pakistan", "quote": "2017 Census of Pakistan The 2017 Census of Pakistan was a detailed enumeration of the Pakistani population which began on 15 March 2017 and ended on 25 May 2017.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0142-0baec16ec402:d03:c0", "entity": "2017 Census", "scope": "Country", "claim": "The 2017 Peru Census was a detailed enumeration and twelfth national population census of Peru.", "answer": "Peru", "quote": "2017 Peru Census The 2017 Peru Census was a detailed enumeration and twelfth national population census of Peru.", "original_document_number": 4}], "initial_answers": ["Pakistan", "Peru"]}

